{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/24c83789364c248d278faf321ce5fee49cef69c0237e7001aafcb173cae2a3a57a5b3d36fde912e03746791dc69425c1a3f366363ec12ff874c1b02c5005739a00\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/54b2edecf8f3025742560cce5b9197620b848ed903340ed538e9556f7d02d7ad0df31c6bf195207a37545d85e065fe81d25e32816fc65f63406cc23a8f4d1ef8574530fc23f03ae0702849ca7ef410\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/59c47295b541bb0735261dcbb2fb1dc20f9cbc1f534dc788bf7d3d0fed600068b1b7735a843d1f133227fc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3d7744f6613244ec94f80e9d15cdac504d19be7af1aacb7c37d701f03204d9681a23d0c61e7c55eb2a5b65e5c599045a20991f64d3d282e35d658eb8416b9a7be12248f578afcac701af46746130b7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/42925f10c7cdab07a466638eeb738398bb9d99668662fd25208d2b271c6b66fa6fd0549396d57f0a4f3b3b68984bb908de011557189385816699e3a5f64b669281bfd2d633a22db49cc618372df36f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3221ecb4425b648788a4730c2649283f1909adbdb2b5c0aa0d524a41b9e24fb3bd839f2c8cfc8cc5b0566e55f935ee361a4e4f76f15a74614ccdbb206f0c7a772be96e501510be0f96a786e1d62081\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b17d48f116c32d241e22f4222acd8fe9cabbf31406db2dec3d57b9bf77a55345c371210bbc2001dad280bc89928e610f1b195ced05578510ac5442df92dae736765312b5e5e54d3634877ed414a0b5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4f5eb30001553bac9b95b4e8386b690035dcf3d55548cbfebd8774bf5487086b04189f151671c02756693147b1aece7e78efc3e559c1b8c4cf1e016cfcbbf39fc661f4591b2ed4f6a55282a0a1eefd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/46e6a41118aef0aa2ea726caeb9d18216c4c316f0d01dfd61fa20b4e9225ba8b1b410ad056b657116ddd7fe53aa46045cf587d7843a43a5d99e8f0b0502d400219896ca064cced33c59ed541b82ae5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c20b43f211e07c660fb0ea0224d2573c89227950cc1b5afabed89ea45a91eadb56b49ceffd79129338e1634878ff3ac8002f669e7f39260ee66bdafb4e5ea390660f54415b774457a28518113eb88e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6c3fb28811cdf09ce9e4979bff41d4d590ee43249f0f989418952cfee5c0973691b04ab23d394d35f20475d266aa2c91dce919ba5cd1f3b0c12f1979ecba62e1fee33fe50f4a6e48d7d6cc674eb4ab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/61d9672a9258a67f9241e44f609cf49e5850055c17fa94ea699464183722962b7948f8eaccfac0b29912ef222131bc19066c2d406cc798b438f32e28acfbadad2b38ca4b64f68dee35ab3aebc5f2c0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5fff53873b87b420545ce09ff3b8916dc4e53bdd39a48d1d326469d248a8c1c9cad3af9c13db10fdbce284bd684d74796d82b36c44269b55084d2c19234bc33c3090fec4fa4494295fca62294c389f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1b91dffeb58cd6fcf43098d5bbd97b146126b9bc8b8c7417529224715458fff53ed8032b917fe8b3b40c1e0015591243d2cb8092b1070144ba2b527d78d15247e0c01b17ac2bfcf2005fbc2d2cb6a1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4febe33742278c57750f7d2fea232dc1e1952a4d967ef696c0cd24753f31c18dd0e107e3a9fbcd37bc882f370b4b19af447ca962b82cf8f2d459525f66d605e2c8c54cdf6915a8c6e01d594e789e29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dcba9b0977a3729974b9b17c2df210418104bb960a78076c8f12a6a726f20edc0ecb2586dfc2082febdcd6dbbbbb228f2ada33049b77e842cb31a40900b47fc831b39577231c5d6c882dbf6b1944a2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e88dcb7b401cb0ad10fcf8955de1f0c9b76af228bc01fd985c3990927d3fe6529b546ce3c835806650f4f6b0f2ef1b2470908cd8d92f42ae1ae211b66c4e6a59fc8c490eba58521dfa62f49d8324a3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/204337557ad831cc12a979075432312d2938596a18cedb8667f5280ef29d38267ff94361b29465d947bfe8478dc515857367a11239cd7f99280da08da06d0a4644868ca0ecaa9ec22b2010c83e98cc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/043c65b91f55ead3c75db5ff19f2d6d076e2594f3c54134bc17935bdad37a6d227e3579910fb2702bbc50795adbfd7b635b555a9a79e2b5148780dc469979f882d252913150b0f4a601d63340b3fd8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/aaf08580a5fe2cbbbdc6332ad3082c640875296e4660a026461ac41cbaeae4ec29d906407f8647c2ba4478b8a91530eae57538519a09371401bd60a284f5a02a82929015171c19826c0f394537c354\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
